WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
[The taxi emerges beside the red stripe on the fourth floor.]

00:02.000 --> 00:06.000
[Engine rises as the taxi sweeps in a broad arc over the field.]

00:06.000 --> 00:08.200
[Engine revs; taxi accelerates into the vortex with a whoosh.]

00:08.200 --> 00:09.000
[The vortex closes with a soft pop.]

00:09.000 --> 00:10.000
[Quiet breeze. The car and vortex are gone.]
